                        <http://example.org/ontology/tapi-common/context/oam-context/oam-job/current-data/photonic-performance-data/otsi-monitoring-pac/chromatic-dispersion> ,
                        <http://example.org/ontology/tapi-common/context/topology-context/topology/node/owned-node-edge-point/cep-list/connection-end-point/otsi-mc-connection-end-point-spec/otsi-termination-pac/otsi-monitoring-pac/chromatic-dispersion> .

