    # source: http://example.org/ontology/tapi-common/context/connectivity-context/connectivity-service/end-point/eth-connectivity-service-end-point-spec/eth-ctp-common-pac/traffic-conditioning-pac/cond-config-list
    skos:definition "This attribute indicates for the conditioner process the conditioning parameters:\n- Queue ID: Indicates the Queue ID\n- Committed Information Rate (CIR): number of bits per second\n- Committed Burst Size (CBS): number of bytes\n- Excess Information Rate (EIR): number of bits per second\n- Excess Burst Size (EBS): number of bytes\n- Coupling flag (CF): 0 or 1\n- Color mode (CM): color-blind and color-aware." ;
