                        <http://example.org/ontology/tapi-common/context/connectivity-context/connectivity-service/end-point/layer-protocol-constraint/otsi-mcg-connectivity-service-end-point-spec/otsi-mc-flexi-grid-config-pac/power-management-config-pac/max-input-power> ,
